[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0133","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0149","title":"Zeus Web Server 3.x 空字节截断远程源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Zeus Web Server 3.x 版本存在空字符截断漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 URL 末尾添加空字符（%00）可绕过服务器对 CGI 文件的解析逻辑，导致任意 CGI 程序源码被直接泄露。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞获取数据库连接信息、业务逻辑等敏感数据，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0149"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.133","remediation":"升级 Zeus Web Server 至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复空字符截断问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx），添加规则拦截包含 `%00` 的 URL 请求：`if ($request_uri ~* \"%00\") { return 403; }`。同时确保 Web 应用目录权限配置为禁止直接访问 CGI 脚本源码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0057.html","http://www.osvdb.org/254","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/977","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3982","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0149","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/999670cb6a939b6c93840ce666941756e4c5dcf5/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0149.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0149.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zeus.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2x73-fgvq-332r/GHSA-2x73-fgvq-332r.json","https://github.com/chushuai/wscan/blob/d154617a1da7302d292d7c3cce9dce39d85ddb0c/data/db_server.xml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0132","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0147","title":"SCO OpenServer SNMPD 默认写入权限漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 操作系统中的 SNMPD 守护进程默认配置存在安全隐患，其 SNMP 团体字符串（community string）被设置为可写权限，导致本地攻击者可通过该默认团体字符串连接到目标系统的 SNMP 服务，进而修改系统 SNMP 配置信息。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 多个版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级较低，攻击者需具备本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0147"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.877","remediation":"建议立即从 SCO 官方 FTP 获取并安装安全公告 SB-00.04a 对应的补丁。作为临时缓解措施，编辑 /etc/snmpd.conf，将默认 SNMP community 字符串从 writable 改为 read-only，并在防火墙层面限制对 UDP 161 端口的访问，仅允许受信管理主机连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/973","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0147","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2000-0147-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rj5j-5wh3-4g3p/GHSA-rj5j-5wh3-4g3p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/973/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001159.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0190","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0215","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.x cu 程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.x 系统中的 cu 程序存在安全漏洞，本地用户可利用该程序的特权缺陷获取系统高级权限，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0215"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-02-08","updated":"2024-11-20","remediation":"建议升级到 SCO 官方发布的安全补丁版本，限制 cu 程序的 suid 权限，或迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T06:45:47.567611578+00:00","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1019"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0131","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0146","title":"Novell GroupWise 5.5 Web Access Enhancement Pack Java Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell GroupWise 5.5 Enhancement Pack 的 Web Access 组件中的 Java Servlet 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证，只需向目标服务器的 Servlet 发送超长 URI 请求，即可触发该漏洞，导致 Java 服务进程耗尽资源或崩溃，从而使 GroupWise Web 邮件服务不可用。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可实施 DoS 攻击，影响范围包括 GroupWise 5.5 Enhancement Pack 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0146"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-07T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.753","remediation":"升级到 Novell GroupWise 6.0 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。若无法升级，可在前端 Web 服务器（如 Apache、IIS）中限制请求 URI 长度不超过 1024 字节，以阻止超长 URL 到达后端 Java Servlet 引擎。同时可在 servlet 容器层（如 Tomcat/JRun）配置 maxHttpHeaderSize 参数，对请求行长度进行服务端限制，缓解因畸形超长 URI 导致的拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0049.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/972","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19744","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0146","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0146.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p6w-4v4r-prx9/GHSA-5p6w-4v4r-prx9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0131.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0131.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0129","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0144","title":"Axis 700 Network Scanner 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Axis 700 Network Scanner 网络文档扫描服务器存在安全绕过漏洞，其管理员 URL 的访问权限未正确限制，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 路径中构造 `..`（点点）目录遍历序列绕过密码认证机制，从而未经授权访问设备管理界面及敏感配置信息。该漏洞影响 Axis 700 网络文档服务器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0144"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-07T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.503","remediation":"升级 Axis 700 Network Scanner 固件至最新版本（Axis 在漏洞报告后发布了修复固件），通过设备 Web 管理界面或 Axis 官方 FTP 获取更新。如无法升级，在防火墙或路由器上限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问设备管理端口（默认 80/443），禁用公网直接访问，并将设备隔离在管理 VLAN 中。Web 管理界面中开启 IP 访问控制列表功能，仅允许管理员 IP 段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0034.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/971","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0144.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0144","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0144.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0144.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rm8x-hfrp-p324/GHSA-rm8x-hfrp-p324.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f913380f-c4b0-4874-8411-4b8b44f1c83c.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001157.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0144.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0395","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0472","title":"ISC innd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags as requested.<value>ISC innd 2.x 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。innd 是一个新闻传输 daemon 服务，处理新闻文章和广播。该漏洞源于 cancel 请求处理代码未对输入的 message ID 进行充分验证，当攻击者发送包含超长 message ID 的取消请求时，会导致缓冲区溢出，使控制流跳转到攻击者控制的代码地址。由于 innd 默认以 root 或高权限用户运行此服务，攻击者可通过网络远程触发此漏洞，获得完全控制权。攻击只需构造一个包含足够长度 malicious payload 的消息 ID 并发送 cancel 请求即可，攻击者无需身份验证即可利用此漏洞执行任意命令。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0472"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48.463","remediation":"建议立即升级 ISC INN (InterNetNews) 到 2.2.3 或更高版本（如 2.3.0+），该版本修复了 innd 2.2.2 中的 cancel 报文缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 NNTP 服务（默认端口 119）仅对可信 IP 开放，或在 innd.conf 中设置严格的 access/access.deny 访问控制列表限制 cancel 命令来源 IP。同时建议监控 NNTP 日志中的异常长 Message-ID 取消请求作为临时监测手段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0003.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0097.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0298.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0330.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1316","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4615","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19998","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0472.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0472","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0472.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0472.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3w6h-rmvf-r37v/GHSA-3w6h-rmvf-r37v.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d238d5bce44b90604ce028c0619c664802195051/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0472.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/innd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0395.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0130","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0145","title":"Debian GNU/Linux gnucash 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 系统中 gnucash 财务软件所依赖的 libguile.so 共享库文件被错误地设置了全局可写权限（world-writable）。本地攻击者可利用此权限缺陷修改该库文件，注入恶意代码，当其他用户或进程加载该库时触发执行，从而导致权限提升或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Debian GNU/Linux 发行版，CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0145"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-05T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.630","remediation":"立即以 root 身份执行 `chmod 755 /usr/lib/libguile.so` 移除全局可写权限，并确认文件属主为 root:root。使用 `find / -type f -perm -o+w -name \"*.so*\" 2>/dev/null` 扫描系统其他存在相同问题的共享库文件，对非预期可写的 .so 文件统一执行 `chmod 755`。同时检查该文件是否被篡改（与原始 deb 包的 md5sum 比对），如有异常应重新安装 libguile 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0145","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0145","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/89a21c5c97923550694ebf8b925bdcbb260bc495/2000/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0145.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hpp7-x4c7-r2pf/GHSA-hpp7-x4c7-r2pf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0145.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88323/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0130.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0116","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0129","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 畸形 .lnk 文件处理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 2.5/a/b 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞位于 SHGetPathFromIDList 函数处理 .lnk 快捷方式文件的过程中。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送特制的 LIST 命令，传入畸形的 .lnk 文件路径触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标 FTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 平台上的 Serv-U FTP Server 2.5/a/b 版本，无需身份认证即可远程触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0129"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.660","remediation":"升级到 Serv-U FTP Server 3.0 或更高版本。若无法升级，在防火墙中禁用主动 FTP 模式并限制 .lnk 文件上传的 MIME 类型检查作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0129","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19743","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0129.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0129","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/188d63c0a7229de21afb50db15586e9fc8647d16/2000/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e38df7a80f8aa0122f9b0f7f660a5a952c979cc6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gxwp-5gp4-w46m/GHSA-gxwp-5gp4-w46m.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0129.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0129.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0074","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0089","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 RDISK 注册表枚举文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 及 Terminal Server Edition 中的 RDISK 实用程序在创建紧急修复磁盘时，会将注册表配置单元信息以临时文件形式存储在磁盘上，且该临时文件权限设置不当，允许本地用户读取其中敏感数据，导致信息泄露。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，通过访问临时目录中的注册表备份文件即可获取系统账户哈希、配置信息等敏感数据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0089"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58.660","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 针对 Windows NT 4.0 和 Terminal Server Edition 的安全更新 (MS00-003)，该补丁修正了 rdisk 工具将注册表配置单元写入临时文件时权限设置不当的问题。如无法安装补丁，可通过限制用户对 rdisk.exe 的执行权限，并删除 `%TEMP%` 目录下 `rdisk*` 临时文件来进行临时缓解。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ249108","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/947","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-004","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0089","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0089.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b877d0b06ff3c980d2ef6a3eb41e4e2bf2ab8ff9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3mg-h7x2-6r8x/GHSA-h3mg-h7x2-6r8x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0089.json","https://github.com/chandanbn/notes/blob/90eb64532f7259c55e5531dfc2726d810d17ef6e/cve5-validation-errors-Jan27.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0333","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0128","title":"Daniel Beckham The Finger Server 0.82 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Daniel Beckham The Finger Server 0.82 Beta 版本中存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Finger 服务发送包含 shell 元字符的特制请求，利用管道符等特殊字符执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 The Finger Server 0.82 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前无官方补丁，建议停止使用该软件或通过防火墙限制访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0128"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-04","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"Daniel Beckham Finger Server 0.82 Beta 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即更换为安全维护中的替代服务（如系统内置 in.fingerd），或直接禁用 finger 服务（79/tcp）。若必须继续使用，应在输入处理层严格过滤 `;&|$()` 等 shell 元字符，并在防火墙限制 finger 端口仅允许可信来源访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0128","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19745","http://www.glazed.org/finger/changelog.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/7610"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0333.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0333.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0309","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0125","title":"Wired Community Software WWWThreads 5.0 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Wired Community Software 开发的 WWWThreads 5.0 论坛软件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对传递给 SQL 查询的数字类型参数及表名未进行充分过滤和净化处理，导致远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，向查询参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而非法获取论坛管理权限，进而实现数据窃取、篡改或完全控制论坛系统。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0125"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.143","remediation":"建议升级至 WWWThreads 5.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 SQL 查询中数值参数和表名参数未过滤的问题。如无法升级，应手动对所有传入 SQL 查询的用户输入进行严格过滤：数值参数使用 int() 强制类型转换，表名参数采用白名单校验，禁止直接拼接用户输入到 SQL 语句中，同时使用参数化查询替代字符串拼接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/967","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10002031027120.15921-100000%40eight.wiretrip.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19741","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0125","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0125.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vmr6-rxwm-662f/GHSA-vmr6-rxwm-662f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0125.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001150.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0193","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0193.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0218","title":"Linux mount/umount 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 和 BSD 系统的 mount/umount 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 umount 命令传递超长相对路径名参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 发行版及 BSD 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地账号才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0218"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.003","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.15 及以上版本，或安装对应发行版的安全补丁（如 Red Hat 的 RHSA-2000:004）。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 mount/umount 二进制文件的 setuid 位：chmod u-s /bin/umount /bin/mount，但会影响普通用户正常卸载文件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6980","http://www.osvdb.org/7004","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/321","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0218","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0218.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2qhm-m4wg-jvfv/GHSA-2qhm-m4wg-jvfv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83001/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0218.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b3dff3bb-99fd-45fe-9b49-3b94145dd1c0.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0193.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0193.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0115","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0127","title":"Progress WebSpeed WSMadmin 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"Progress Webspeed 配置程序未正确禁用对 WSMadmin 管理工具的访问权限，远程攻击者可通过 wsisa.dll 利用该配置缺陷，无需身份认证即可获取系统管理权限。该漏洞影响 Progress Webspeed 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者可借此完全控制目标 Web 服务及应用系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0127"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.400","remediation":"立即升级 Progress Webspeed 至 KB 19412 补丁对应版本，或限制通过 Web 服务器配置禁止对 wsisa.dll 及 WSMadmin 管理接口的远程访问，仅允许受信任 IP 段访问该管理路径，并确保 Webspeed 配置程序正确禁用 WSMadmin 实用工具的未授权访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.progress.com/services/support/cgi-bin/techweb-kbase.cgi/webkb.html?kbid=19412&keywords=security%20Webspeed","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0127","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0127.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/805.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8071b769fede4de3c82d6e52f9a03fe18758c5f0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9qx-grqj-38gf/GHSA-g9qx-grqj-38gf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/webspeed.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0127.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0115.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0115.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0113","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0124","title":"surfCONTROL SuperScout 安全绕过漏洞","description":"surfCONTROL SuperScout 网页内容过滤软件在处理以点号（.）结尾的网站 URL 时存在分类失效漏洞。当用户访问带有尾部点号的域名时，该软件无法正确识别和匹配预设的访问控制策略，导致被限制访问的网站被错误地归类为允许访问，从而使内部用户能够绕过 Web 访问限制规则。攻击者只需在受限制网站的域名末尾添加一个点号即可触发该漏洞，利用难度极低，影响企业内容过滤策略的有效性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0124"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:03.020","remediation":"升级到 surfCONTROL SuperScout 最新可用版本，或迁移至受支持的 Web 过滤解决方案（如 Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps 或 Forcepoint Web Security）。在 URL 过滤规则中增加对尾随点号（.）的规范化处理，确保所有 URL 在分类前去除末尾点号。如无法升级，在代理服务器或网关层面添加自定义规则，将含末尾点号的 URL 重写为标准格式后再进行过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0124","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0124.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gh2j-73gh-h7q7/GHSA-gh2j-73gh-h7q7.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0124.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8892aa1b-c8ff-4996-bb27-2cb657cfab4f.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0113.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0110","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0122","title":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions htimage.exe 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 中的 htimage.exe CGI 程序存在物理路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 GET 请求即可触发该程序返回详细的错误信息，从而获取虚拟目录对应的真实物理路径。该漏洞导致服务器敏感信息暴露，可能辅助攻击者实施进一步渗透攻击。受影响版本包括 Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 的多个版本，建议禁用 htimage.exe 或安装厂商补丁进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0122"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02.767","remediation":"升级 Microsoft FrontPage Server Extensions 至 2000 年 3 月之后的安全更新版本，或禁用 htimage.exe CGI 程序的匿名访问。在 IIS 中设置 htimage.exe 仅允许经过身份验证的用户访问，或在 Web 服务器上删除或重命名该 CGI 文件以彻底消除路径泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/470458/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/964","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/34719","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0122","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0122.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-353v-v7pq-8gpc/GHSA-353v-v7pq-8gpc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/964/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0122.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001148.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0110.toml"}]